{#
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  THE MENU — a bottom sheet with pushed sub-views
  REFERENCE §7.4 · design/MobileMenu.dc.html · skill §4
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Opened by the tab bar's fifth tab. From `top:52px`, so the app bar behind it stays in
  view and the sheet reads as something OVER the page. Sub-views push inside the sheet
  with a back button — never an accordion, which hides a menu's own contents behind a
  second guess. `chrome.js` pushes one history entry on open, so the phone's back gesture
  closes the sheet before it leaves the page.

  ── WHAT IS THE PHASE FILE'S AND WHAT IS THE DC'S ───────────────────────────

  The Explore list is §7.4's — Discover, Pulse, Giving, Shop, Legacy Vault, Blog,
  Register. The DC draws Leaderboard where the phase file says Blog; the phase file
  outranks the DC (REFERENCE §0). Every size, gap and radius is the DC's.

  The points figure is DM Sans with tabular figures, not the DC's JetBrains Mono: mono is
  for references and codes only, never a stat (REFERENCE §6.2, §18.3; owner, GAPS Q5).
  The wordmark line is `--ag-soft`, not the DC's `#8b9295` — that is `--ag-mute`, which
  is never a word (Accent::ACCEPTED).

  ── STATUS SAYS WHAT WAS MEASURED, OR NOTHING ───────────────────────────────

  The DC draws a live dot and "Working". `status_light()` is the last state the
  scheduled check RECORDED, and null when that record is stale or missing — and then the
  row carries no state at all. A typed "Working" is the cached all-clear that outlives
  the outage it missed (SystemStatus::light()).

  ── COOKIES IS A HOOK, NOT A FEATURE ───────────────────────────────────────

  The Cookies link goes to `/cookies#choices` and carries `data-ag-do="consent-open"`,
  the hook the cookie preferences (§7.9, built after this phase) bind to re-open the
  choice in place. With nothing bound it is an ordinary link to the policy's choices.
#}
{% set _ini = member_name ? (member_name|split(' ')|filter(w => w != '')|map(w => w|first)|join|upper|slice(0, 2)) : 'AG' %}
{% set _status = status_light() %}
<div class="ag-scrim" data-ag-menu-scrim></div>

<div class="ag-sheet ag-menu" id="ag-menu" data-ag-menu-sheet role="dialog" aria-modal="true"
     aria-labelledby="ag-menu-title" inert
     data-title-main="{{ 'Menu'|trans }}" data-title-display="{{ 'Display & reading'|trans }}"
     data-title-lang="{{ 'Language'|trans }}">

  <span class="ag-sheet__grabber" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <div class="ag-sheet__head ag-menu__head">
    {# `visibility`, never `hidden`: the head is a `44px 1fr 44px` grid, and `display:none`
       would take the cell with it and slide the title into the back button's column. #}
    <button type="button" class="ag-appbar__icon ag-menu__back" data-ag-menu-back aria-label="{{ 'Back to menu'|trans }}" data-hide>
      <svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg>
    </button>
    <h2 class="ag-menu__title" id="ag-menu-title" data-ag-menu-title>{{ 'Menu'|trans }}</h2>
    <button type="button" class="ag-appbar__icon" data-ag-menu-close aria-label="{{ 'Close menu'|trans }}">
      <span class="ag-menu__x"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="ag-sheet__body ag-menu__body" data-ag-menu-body>

    {# ── MAIN ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
    <div class="ag-menu__view" data-ag-menu-view="main">

      {% if is_member %}
        <a class="ag-menu__me" href="/account">
          <span class="ag-menu__av" aria-hidden="true">{{ _ini }}</span>
          <span class="ag-menu__who">
            <b class="ag-menu__name">{{ member_name|default('Your account'|trans) }}</b>
            <span class="ag-menu__view-p">{{ 'View your profile'|trans }}</span>
          </span>
          {# A function, so a page whose Menu is never opened still costs one memoised
             read; null when unknown, and the figure is then left out rather than printed
             as a confident nought. #}
          {% set _pts = member_points() %}
          {% if _pts is not null %}
            <span class="ag-menu__pts"><b class="ag-num">{{ _pts|number_format }}</b><span>{{ 'points'|trans }}</span></span>
          {% endif %}
        </a>
      {% else %}
        <div class="ag-menu__join">
          <b class="ag-menu__join-t">{{ 'Join Africa GATES'|trans }}</b>
          <span class="ag-menu__join-p">{{ 'Nominate, vote and keep your recognitions in one place.'|trans }}</span>
          <a class="ag-menu__join-b" href="/account/login">{{ 'Sign in or join'|trans }}</a>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      <nav class="ag-menu__quick" aria-label="{{ 'Participate'|trans }}">
        {% for q in [
          {href:'/nominate', label:'Nominate', tone:'grow',   d:'M12 5v14M5 12h14'},
          {href:'/vote',     label:'Vote',     tone:'act',    d:'M4 12.5 9 17.5 20 6.5'},
          {href:'/awards',   label:'Awards',   tone:'honour', d:'M5 16 3 6l5 4 4-6 4 6 5-4-2 10z'},
          {href:'/events',   label:'Events',   tone:'act',    d:'M4 5h16v15H4zM4 10h16M9 3v4M15 3v4'}
        ] %}
          <a class="ag-menu__tile" href="{{ q.href }}">
            <span class="ag-menu__tile-i ag-tone--{{ q.tone }}" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="{{ q.d }}"></path></svg></span>
            <span class="ag-menu__tile-l">{{ q.label|trans }}</span>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </nav>

      <section class="ag-menu__sec" aria-labelledby="ag-menu-h-explore">
        <h3 class="ag-menu__h" id="ag-menu-h-explore">{{ 'Explore'|trans }}</h3>
        <div class="ag-list ag-menu__list">
          {% for i in [
            {href:'/discover',         label:'Discover',           tone:'plain',  d:'M11 4a7 7 0 1 0 0 14 7 7 0 0 0 0-14ZM20 20l-3.6-3.6'},
            {href:'/pulse',            label:'Pulse',              tone:'give',   d:'M5 3h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2ZM10 8.5l5 3.5-5 3.5z'},
            {href:'/giving',           label:'Giving',             tone:'give',   d:'M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.6l-1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z'},
            {href:'/shop',             label:'Shop',               tone:'act',    d:'M6 7h12l-1 13H7zM9 7a3 3 0 0 1 6 0'},
            {href:'/legacy',           label:'Legacy Vault',       tone:'honour', d:'M4 8h16v12H4zM2 4h20v4H2z'},
            {href:'/blog',             label:'Blog',               tone:'plain',  d:'M4 5h16M4 10h16M4 15h10'},
            {href:'/account/register', label:'Register a profile', tone:'honour', d:'M16 11a4 4 0 1 0-8 0M3 21a9 9 0 0 1 18 0'}
          ] %}
            <a class="ag-list__row" href="{{ i.href }}">
              <span class="ag-icon-tile ag-tone--{{ i.tone }}" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="{{ i.d }}"></path></svg></span>
              <span class="ag-list__label">{{ i.label|trans }}</span>
              <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ag-menu__sec" aria-labelledby="ag-menu-h-settings">
        <h3 class="ag-menu__h" id="ag-menu-h-settings">{{ 'Settings'|trans }}</h3>
        <div class="ag-list ag-menu__list">
          <button type="button" class="ag-list__row" data-ag-menu-to="display">
            <span class="ag-icon-tile ag-tone--set" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7V5h16v2M9 19h6M12 5v14"></path></svg></span>
            <span class="ag-list__label">{{ 'Display & reading'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="ag-list__value" data-ag-size-label
                  data-l0="{{ 'Standard'|trans }}" data-l1="{{ 'Large'|trans }}" data-l2="{{ 'Largest'|trans }}">{{ 'Standard'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="ag-list__row" data-ag-menu-to="lang">
            <span class="ag-icon-tile ag-tone--set" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.7 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.3-3.8 9c-2.5-2.7-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.7 12 3Z"></path></svg></span>
            <span class="ag-list__label">{{ 'Language'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="ag-list__value" lang="{{ lang() }}">{{ lang_name() }}</span>
            <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
          </button>
          {% if is_member %}
            <a class="ag-list__row" href="/account#notifications">
              <span class="ag-icon-tile ag-tone--set" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9M10 21h4"></path></svg></span>
              <span class="ag-list__label">{{ 'Notifications'|trans }}</span>
              <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
            </a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ag-menu__sec" aria-labelledby="ag-menu-h-help">
        <h3 class="ag-menu__h" id="ag-menu-h-help">{{ 'Help'|trans }}</h3>
        <div class="ag-list ag-menu__list">
          <a class="ag-list__row" href="/help">
            <span class="ag-icon-tile ag-tone--set" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 17h.01M9.1 9a3 3 0 1 1 4 2.8c-.7.3-1.1 1-1.1 1.7V14"></path></svg></span>
            <span class="ag-list__label">{{ 'Help Centre'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
          </a>
          <a class="ag-list__row" href="/integrity">
            <span class="ag-icon-tile ag-tone--set" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2.4l7.6 2.7v5.8c0 4.7-3.1 8.3-7.6 10-4.5-1.7-7.6-5.3-7.6-10V5.1z"></path></svg></span>
            <span class="ag-list__label">{{ 'Integrity Center'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
          </a>
          <a class="ag-list__row" href="/status">
            <span class="ag-icon-tile ag-tone--set" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12h4l3-7 4 14 3-7h4"></path></svg></span>
            <span class="ag-list__label">{{ 'Status'|trans }}</span>
            {% if _status %}
              {# Never the colour alone: the word is the state, the dot repeats it. #}
              <span class="ag-menu__live ag-menu__live--{{ _status.status }}"><span class="ag-menu__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ _status.label|trans }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="ag-menu__foot">
        <nav class="ag-menu__legal" aria-label="{{ 'Legal'|trans }}">
          <a href="/privacy">{{ 'Privacy'|trans }}</a>
          <a href="/terms">{{ 'Terms'|trans }}</a>
          <a href="/cookies#choices" data-ag-do="consent-open">{{ 'Cookies'|trans }}</a>
        </nav>
        {% if is_member %}
          {# A POST with the token, not a link a prefetch could follow. #}
          <form method="post" action="/account/logout" class="ag-menu__out">
            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token }}">
            <button type="submit" class="ag-menu__signout">{{ 'Sign out'|trans }}</button>
          </form>
        {% endif %}
        <span class="ag-menu__mark">{{ 'Africa GATES · An Afrovanguard initiative'|trans }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# ── DISPLAY & READING ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
    <div class="ag-menu__view" data-ag-menu-view="display" hidden>
      <div class="ag-menu__card">
        {% include 'partials/display-reading.twig' with { uid: 'menu' } %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {# ── LANGUAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
    {# Links, not radios: following one navigates and the middleware stores the choice,
       so this works with scripting off. The name is in its own language with `lang`, and
       English below for somebody choosing on another person's behalf. #}
    <div class="ag-menu__view" data-ag-menu-view="lang" hidden>
      <div class="ag-list ag-menu__list" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'Language'|trans }}">
        {% for l in languages() %}
          <a class="ag-list__row ag-menu__lang" href="{{ lang_url(l.code) }}" hreflang="{{ l.code }}"
             {% if l.code == lang() %}aria-current="true"{% endif %}>
            <span class="ag-list__b">
              <span class="ag-list__label" lang="{{ l.code }}" dir="{{ l.dir }}">{{ l.name }}</span>
              <span class="ag-menu__en">{{ l.english|trans }}</span>
            </span>
            {% if l.code == lang() %}
              <svg class="ag-menu__tick" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5 8.5 15 16 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            {% endif %}
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
